### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@weddingId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### =========================================================================
### ENDPOINTS PÚBLICOS (Invitados y Web Pública)
### =========================================================================

### 1. Obtener la boda actual (datos generales y personalización para la web pública)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/wedding

### 2. Obtener boda pública por ID específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/public/wedding/{{weddingId}}

### =========================================================================
### ENDPOINTS DE ADMINISTRACIÓN (Panel Privado)
### =========================================================================

### 3. Obtener la configuración actual de la boda
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings/current

### 4. Listar todas las bodas registradas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings

### 5. Obtener detalle de la boda por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings/{{weddingId}}

### 6. Actualizar la boda actual (incluyendo personalización JSONB de temas y contenido)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings/current
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partner1Name": "Mario",
  "partner2Name": "Laura",
  "weddingDate": "2026-06-21",
  "content": {
    "theme": "elegante-floral",
    "primaryColor": "#d4af37",
    "welcomeMessage": "¡Nos casamos y queremos celebrarlo contigo!",
    "heroImageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/demo/image/upload/sample.jpg",
    "hashtag": "#BodaMarioYLaura2026",
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "¿Hay código de vestimenta?",
        "answer": "Traje formal / vestido de cóctel."
      },
      {
        "question": "¿Habrá transporte?",
        "answer": "Habrá autobuses desde el centro de la ciudad hacia la finca."
      }
    ]
  }
}

### 7. Crear una nueva boda
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partner1Name": "Alejandro",
  "partner2Name": "Beatriz",
  "weddingDate": "2027-05-15",
  "content": {
    "theme": "minimalista"
  }
}

### 8. Actualizar boda por ID (sustituye {{newWeddingId}} por el devuelto en la petición 7)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings/aaea484f-ca10-4ca4-a52d-77f94eeca9c8
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partner1Name": "Alejandro",
  "partner2Name": "Beatriz",
  "weddingDate": "2027-05-16",
  "content": {
    "theme": "vintage",
    "notes": "Fecha modificada al domingo"
  }
}

### 9. Eliminar boda por ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings/aaea484f-ca10-4ca4-a52d-77f94eeca9c8

### =========================================================================
### CASOS DE ERROR Y VALIDACIÓN
### =========================================================================

### 10. 404 - Boda no encontrada por UUID inexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 11. 400 - Validación fallida: nombres en blanco y fecha nula
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/weddings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partner1Name": "",
  "partner2Name": "   ",
  "weddingDate": null
}
